        <item>
            <title>1.8.1</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 15:57:46 +0530</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>161</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.8.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>App Store updates through mas show real progress (&quot;Downloading… 45%&quot;), then &quot;Installing…&quot;, and share the run&#x27;s one Touch ID prompt.</li>
  <li>Cancel is offered only while an App Store update waits its turn; once mas starts it can&#x27;t be stopped partway.</li>
  <li>A selected row&#x27;s status and versions stay readable (white on the blue selection).</li>
  <li>After updating from a Keel version that didn&#x27;t record what you&#x27;d seen, the new version&#x27;s notes still show once.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
